 "insight": [
  "The main categories of goods exported by Luxembourg in 2025 are machinery and mechanical appliances, plastics and articles thereof, and vehicles and parts.",
  "Exports total 16.25 billion euros, with the top three categories making up 31.8% of exports.",
  "Imports are led by vehicles and parts, machinery and mechanical appliances, and mineral fuels and oils, totaling 25.10 billion euros.",
  "The top three imports account for 33.6% of total imports, while total trade amounts to 41.35 billion euros with machinery and vehicles as the largest categories.",
  "Data values are nominal euros and include a confidential portion of 3.8% that is shown separately and not detailed."
